  "conditional_unbiasedness": "ZIP-SR probabilities interpolate f(v)=1/(sqrt(v/c2_t)+eps) between adjacent v-grid points. This is one-step conditional real-arithmetic unbiasedness for fixed current v, not unbiased v, not unchanged Adam recurrence, not bitwise FP32 equality. Rounded scale/output and stochastic histories further break exact equivalence.",
